# Fix Exar 503 HAProxy Network

- Timestamp: 2026-09-06 ~08:30 UTC+3:30
- Host: t3-new (2.144.27.124) via SSH port 443
- Result: success

## Cause
Auth deploy put `exar-webui` / `exar-api` on `exar-net` only. HAProxy is on `t3-net`, so backends failed DNS (`bad address`) and returned 503.

## Fix
- `docker network connect t3-net exar-webui`
- `docker network connect t3-net exar-api`
- Remote + local compose default network restored to `t3-net`

## Verification
- Public https://exar.xaigrok.ir/ and /login -> 200
